# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] d.js is dynamically imported by c.js but also statically imported by e.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] data.json is dynamically imported by c.js but also statically imported by e.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

